sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Transaction
  participant B as Buffer pool
  participant L as Log on disk
  participant D as Data file
  T->>B: UPDATE page in memory
  T->>B: log record LSN 41
  T->>B: COMMIT record LSN 42
  B->>L: flush log to LSN 42
  L-->>T: durable, ack the client
  B->>D: later: write the page
  Note over B,D: only after the log up to its LSN is flushed
